bug_report:
[modules] ICE in maybe_clone_body when calling virtual destructor from instantiated template
The following sample ICEs on trunk:


  // a.cpp
  module;
  struct S {
    virtual ~S() = default;
    virtual void f() = 0;
  };
  module M:a;
  S *p;
  template <typename T> void format(T) { p->~S(); }
  template void format(int);

  // m.cpp
  export module M;
  import :a;


